MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
More permanent variables can be allocated, and they start at zero.
MCPVAR 40
MCSET P40=6
MCSET P39=P40*7
%P39. and %P40.
A variable may be named by an expression, which is how an array is
written.
MCSET P1=3
MCSET PP1=99
%P3. is the same as %PP1.
MCSET P2=1
%PPP2. reaches P3 through P1
